{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605We welcome your live streams of this game!\u2605</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701790/extras/7ba77b18dd119684ee9fc5663f40a4d4.poster.avif?t=1763132950\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701790/extras/7ba77b18dd119684ee9fc5663f40a4d4.webm?t=1763132950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701790/extras/7ba77b18dd119684ee9fc5663f40a4d4.mp4?t=1763132950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to read any manuals! Visual tutorials teach you the game rules and how to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a non-Euclidean geometric minesweeper game that is logically solvable without guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It uses our original game engine developed for hyperbolic geometry and our original puzzle solver optimized for minesweeper problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play this well-known genre of game in a warped space and solve all problems using only pure logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course standard features like quick marking, quick opening and undo functions are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701790/extras/5b9a5aba61eb4663b3b51d56aa4d30c3.poster.avif?t=1763132950\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701790/extras/5b9a5aba61eb4663b3b51d56aa4d30c3.webm?t=1763132950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701790/extras/5b9a5aba61eb4663b3b51d56aa4d30c3.mp4?t=1763132950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Light, dark, classic and modern themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Independent volume control and mute functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Settings and game data are automatically saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eight types of tessellation patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy and hard logic difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large range of game field sizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Number of mines can be set in custom mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Problem IDs enable time trials with your mates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- TATE mode supported!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701790/extras/45a13d99de455a67433ba90418d805a3.avif?t=1763132950\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605Dive into M.C. Escher's world!\u2605</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701790?t=1763132950","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701790?t=1763132950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701790/971ab7a73539cb4e06ad7ab84c85e89a57a1494e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763132950","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701790/971ab7a73539cb4e06ad7ab84c85e89a57a1494e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763132950","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605We welcome your live streams of this game!\u2605</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam